<title>BELGIUM: SBBM 1996 PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>SBBM 1996 PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996 financial year</p>
<p>(in million Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net (excludes minorities)   183    vs   134.5 </p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)		 255    vs   same</p>
<p>Note - Societe Belge des Betons/Belgische Betonmaatschappij,</p>
<p>a Belgian building group, said in a statement that it hoped that</p>
<p>work volume in 1997 would be similar to last year's.</p>
<p>    Operating profit			418.3  vs    499.5</p>
<p>    Current profit			  282.4  vs    358.5</p>
<p>    Turnover			     22,807    vs 21,734</p>
<p>NOTE - SBBM also said that profit margins in Belgium</p>
<p>remained unsatisfactory. Margins abroad are better, but carry a</p>
<p>larger risk, it added.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
